# Literate pages

> Links name symbols: [std.list.sort], [`list.sort`] through the hidden import below, [Option] and [Some] from the prelude, and [`Parsed.stop`], a field. [std.list.merge_by] isn't exported, [nothing.here] isn't anything, and [x, y] and [0] are only text. A definition wins: [sort].

Every page of this site is also Markdown: replace `.html` with `.md`.

